{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "b3f2a8b0-7e3a-4a1a-9f1a-myfabulist-api-v1",
    "name": "MyFabulist API v1",
    "description": "REST API for MyFabulist (Folders -> Lists -> Tasks). Every endpoint lives under /api/v1 and requires a Sanctum bearer token plus a verified email (auth:sanctum + verified middleware).\n\nHow to get a token (there is no self-serve token endpoint yet):\n1. `php artisan tinker`\n2. `$user = \\App\\Models\\User::where('email', 'test@example.com')->first();`\n3. `$user->createToken('postman')->plainTextToken`\n4. Paste the printed token into the collection variable `token` below.\n\nSet `base_url` to match your environment (defaults to `http://myfabulist.test:8000`, i.e. APP_URL).\n\nSuggested run order to exercise the whole API: Auth -> Inbox -> Folders (List, Create) -> Lists (Create, List Tasks, Create Task) -> Tasks (Get, Update, Complete, Restore, Move) -> Starred -> Ordering -> Folders (Delete) / Lists (Delete) / Tasks (Delete). The Create requests auto-save their id into `folder_id` / `list_id` / `task_id` so the rest of the collection can chain off them.\n\nResponse envelope:\n- success: `{\"data\": ...}`\n- validation error: `{\"message\": ..., \"errors\": {...}}`\n- domain error: `{\"message\": ..., \"error_code\": \"...\"}`",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      { "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url", "value": "http://myfabulist.test:8000", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "folder_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "list_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "task_id", "value": "", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Current User",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/user"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status is 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Inbox",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Inbox",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/inbox"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status is 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (body.data && body.data.list && body.data.list.id) {",
                  "        pm.collectionVariables.set('list_id', body.data.list.id);",
                  "    }",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
